# ============================================================================
# All About Pawz — Environment
# ============================================================================
# Architecture (client-side rendering):
#   - Public pages are static shells. Data sections fetch from the site's own
#     API routes (/api/cms/*) AFTER the page paints — in the browser.
#   - Supabase credentials are used ONLY server-side (in the API routes).
#     The public site needs ZERO browser-exposed keys.
#   - Sign-up/sign-in is Supabase Auth. Transactional email is Resend,
#     called server-side (every send is audited in the email_messages table).
#   - No ADMIN_EMAILS required: any signed-in account has admin access.
#     (Optionally set ADMIN_EMAILS to restrict admin to specific addresses.)
#
# The site renders even with these unset (sections show skeletons then
# gracefully empty). Fill in real values for full functionality.
# ============================================================================

# --- REQUIRED: Supabase (the backend — server-side only) ---
# Get these from: Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
# No NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix needed — the site's data flows through /api/cms/*.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key

# --- REQUIRED: Stripe (payments — server-side only) ---
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_or_test_key
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_your_webhook_secret

# --- REQUIRED: Resend (transactional email — server-side only) ---
# Booking confirmations, consultation notifications, payment receipts.
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_key

# --- OPTIONAL: browser sign-in (admin portal / customer portal login) ---
# The login forms talk directly to Supabase Auth from the browser, which
# requires these two values baked into the client bundle. If unset, the
# public site works fully; only portal login is unavailable.
# (Vercel may show an advisory on NEXT_PUBLIC_ vars — for these two it is
# expected and safe: the anon key is protected by Supabase RLS.)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# --- OPTIONAL: site (canonical domain for Stripe callbacks + emails) ---
# Defaults to https://aapawz.com when unset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://aapawz.com

# --- OPTIONAL: restrict admin access to specific emails ---
# Comma-separated. When unset, every signed-in account is admin.
# ADMIN_EMAILS=admin@yourdomain.com
